  "stakes": {
    "do": "Count the stones. Write the count down. Come back and count again, which is the entire mechanic and the reason this place is built for return visits.",
    "lose": "Strain, slowly, over visits. Nothing here moves at you.",
    "decide": "Whether to tell anyone the count changed, and whether to ask Verona Ashcombe who is tending a plot with no family left to tend it."
  },
  "art_gap": "Reads as a fenced patch of grass with rocks in it. There are no headstones: the rocks are standing in for them and the single most important readable object in the county is missing. A headstone prop is the highest-value art on this entire page."
}
